# -------------------------------------------------
# Résultats code_saturne (à ignorer partout)
# -------------------------------------------------
**/RESU/**
**/RESU_COUPLING/**
# Cases generated by `csauto prepare`
**/RUNS/**

# -------------------------------------------------
# code_saturne (fichiers générés)
# -------------------------------------------------
# Lien vers l'exécutable créé dans DATA/
**/DATA/code_saturne
*.cfg
*.cid
*.stdout
*.stderr
*.log
**/.cache/
**/.config/
# -------------------------------------------------
# VTK / ParaView / Ensight (post-traitement)
# -------------------------------------------------
*.vtu
*.pvtu
*.pvd
*.vtk
*.vtm
*.vtmb
*.case

# -------------------------------------------------
# Python
# -------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.npz

# -------------------------------------------------
# Divers
# -------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
**/validation/**

*.csv
*.py
# ... but case input data shipped with a tutorial (e.g. time tables) is kept
!**/CASE/DATA/*.csv
# ... as is the DOE table of a csauto campaign
!**/doe.csv
# ... and the FMU generator and co-simulation master of an FMI tutorial
!**/FMU/*.py

# -------------------------------------------------
# FMU build output of an FMI tutorial (rebuilt by `make` in FMU/)
# -------------------------------------------------
**/FMU/binaries/
**/FMU/code_saturne_fmu_variables.h
*.fmu
